'''Hikakin''' (ヒカキン) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Hikakin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hikakin
|image = E 432.png
|appearance = [[Hikakin Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000円 - 7,900円
}}

==Enemy==
A walking money bag, not much to fear except its range if you're in early-game.

==Strategy==
This enemy can be beaten through using any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]].

